WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.700
LivingShield design concept. A nominal 300 mm triangular module with open faces and connector holes.

00:05.700 --> 00:08.800
Illustrative existing condition: an unprotected riverbank. This scene is not a survey of a real township bank.

00:08.800 --> 00:15.400
Installation concept: modules are placed in interlocking courses, starting at the toe.

00:15.400 --> 00:18.300
Planting concept: illustrative vegetation establishes around the module openings. Species and growth require validation.

00:18.300 --> 00:21.000
The planted installation is a design intention. Stability, flow and habitat benefits have not been measured by this animation.
